{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36706","headline":"广陵李仆射借示近诗因投献 · 罗隐","name":"广陵李仆射借示近诗因投献","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"朝论国计暮论兵，余力犹随凤藻生。\n语继盘盂抛俗格，气兼河岳带商声。\n闲寻绮思千花丽，静想高吟六义清。\n天柄已持尧典在，更堪回首问缘情。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"罗隐","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_36706.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36706","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}